        "Given: u = 100*sqrt(2)*cos(100*pi*t) V, nên omega = 100*pi rad/s; R = 30 ohm; L = 0,4/pi H; C = 1,25.10^-4/pi F. Find: phi = phi_u - phi_i (rad).",
